// AWS IAM Service-Specific Credential Created  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1098.001
// Detects creation of service-specific credentials (CreateServiceSpecificCredential), e.g. for CodeCommit. These are an alternative…
// False positives: Developers provisioning CodeCommit/HTTPS Git credentials.
// Source: rules/persistence/iam-create-service-specific-credential.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^CreateServiceSpecificCredential$/i eventSource=/^iam\.amazonaws\.com$/i
